y.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will hit you a few minutes later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And some will only make sense after that one friend spends half an hour explaining why they were funny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149550/extras/3eb23d90d8dae5d0a52fe9636cfa33e7.poster.avif?t=1787047216\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149550/extras/3eb23d90d8dae5d0a52fe9636cfa33e7.webm?t=1787047216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149550/extras/3eb23d90d8dae5d0a52fe9636cfa33e7.mp4?t=1787047216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMIX ZERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a living comic book.</strong> <strong>Smash through its frames.</strong> <strong>Fight and repair your weapons.</strong> <strong>Take on quests.</strong> <strong>Talk to strange creatures.</strong> <strong>Don’t lose your color.</strong> <strong>And try to find your way home in a world where humans are scarier than monsters.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Comix Zero is a unique COMIXVANIA set inside a living comic book. Explore its pages, jump between panels, break their borders, uncover secrets, and fight your way through a dark fantasy world. Turn the page — or die!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149550/26c70068ca065a73cfab7bb4cf0a2c4682beb0d6/header.jpg?t=1787047216", "capsule_image": "https://share